1
00:00:00,172 --> 00:00:02,042
(Leonard:)Hey, Barry, we're in trouble.

2
00:00:02,041 --> 00:00:04,811
(Leonard:)We need liquid helium... does the
department have any we can use?

3
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:06,180
Sorry, there's a shortage.

4
00:00:06,178 --> 00:00:08,808
(Barry:)And what we do have I need for
my quantum excitation study.

5
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:10,984
(Sheldon:)But you won't
need much for that.

6
00:00:10,983 --> 00:00:12,353
True, but if it's successful,

7
00:00:12,351 --> 00:00:14,981
I'm having a party
with balloons.

8
00:00:14,987 --> 00:00:16,987
(Leonard:)Come on, Barry,
there's a Swedish team

9
00:00:16,989 --> 00:00:18,619
(Leonard:)trying to run our
experiment before us.

10
00:00:18,624 --> 00:00:19,794
(Leonard:)Can't you spare any?

11
00:00:19,792 --> 00:00:22,492
(Barry:)Be honest... if the shoe
was on the other foot,

12
00:00:22,495 --> 00:00:24,665
(Barry:)would you do this for me?

13
00:00:24,664 --> 00:00:27,164
(Leonard:)Yes.
No chance.

14
00:00:27,166 --> 00:00:28,896
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

15
00:00:28,901 --> 00:00:30,671
(Sheldon:)He said be honest,
so I was honest.

16
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:33,100
(Sheldon:)Didn't your mother tell you?
It's the best policy.

17
00:00:33,105 --> 00:00:34,905
(Sheldon:)So, what do you say?

18
00:00:34,907 --> 00:00:36,007
(Barry:)Hell no.

19
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:41,580
(Sheldon:)He could've
softened the blow.

20
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,950
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

